All 121 tests pass, lint is clean, build succeeds. Here is a summary of every change made:

**`index.html`** — Added `#intro-panel` between the `<h2>` and the toolbar, containing the heading, tagline, three bullet points, and both CTA buttons. The panel is a real DOM element that `main.ts` toggles with `hidden`.

**`src/ui/contacts.ts`** — Two copy fixes:
- Empty state now reads "No contacts yet. Add your first contact above, or try the demo."
- Phone validation failure now shows "Enter a 10-digit number, or 911 or 988." instead of the raw `PhoneError` message.

**`src/ui/demo.ts`** — Extracted `loadDemo()` as a named export. It skips the confirm dialog when the directory is empty and shows it only when contacts already exist. `initDemoButton` (the toolbar button) now calls `loadDemo`, so the existing confirm behaviour is preserved there too.

**`src/main.ts`** — Added `updateIntroPanel()` (hides/shows `#intro-panel` based on `state.contacts.length`) and `initIntroPanel()` (wires "Try the demo" and "Start the drill" buttons). `initContacts` now also calls `updateIntroPanel` after every save so the panel disappears the moment a contact is added manually.

**`src/styles/directory.css`** — New `.intro-panel`, `.intro-heading`, `.intro-tagline`, `.intro-points`, and `.intro-actions` rules. Buttons wrap at 320 px with no horizontal scroll.

**`requirements.md`** — Added R10 with four acceptance criteria.

**`tasks.md`** — Added ticked T15 referencing R10.
